  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Airport Reform and Improvement Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Reforma y Mejoramiento Aeropuerto</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM WOULD INCLUDE THE RREHABILITATION OF THE RUNWAY, TAXIWAY AND APRON AT THE NORMAN MANLEY INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT IN KINGSTON, THE REHABILITATION AND UPGRADE OF THE ISLAND-WIDE COMMUNICATIONS AND NAVIGATION SYSTEM, AND THE IMPLEMENTATION OF INSTITUTIONAL AND POLICY REFORMS IN THE AIRPORT SECTOR.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
